OL,3,GNEWSA'Multiple searches' after four
OL,4,Aarson attack murders
OL,5,
OL,6,FSearches have been carried out at
OL,7,Fseveral premises in Waterford after
OL,8,Ffour members of the same family were
OL,9,Fkilled in an arson attack in the city.
OL,11,FKim English, Philip English and two of
OL,12,Ftheir children - nine-year-old Jayden
OL,13,Fand 12-year-old Callum - died after
OL,14,Ftheir home in Birch Avenue was set on
OL,15,Ffire on Tuesday.
OL,17,FGardai (Irish police) described the
OL,18,Finvestigation into their murders as
OL,19,F"intense in nature and very active".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
