OL,3,GNEWSA'Multiple searches' after four
OL,4,Aarson attack murders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey said "multiple searches" were
OL,7,Fconducted on Tuesday evening and
OL,8,Fvehicles and electronic devices have
OL,9,Fbeen seized for technical examination.
